{
    "_doc": "House activities every home faction offers its own home members (permanent and temporary home - guests yes, prisoners no: each activity's eligibility), and the family doctor every faction may assign. Not for subfactions / worker pools (Manageable.OffersSharedHouseContent). Each activity is bound to furniture by the command it offers (facility.comTag - never a room ID: the player may move furniture), so a home only offers what its furniture allows (RecreationUtility.FacilityAvailable); the room is chosen when the activity's job is created. Only home members search for these (RecreationUtility.ActivitySources); anyone else may still be invited (BookingCheck.Passes). A faction's own MapPlan.houseActivities entry with the same ID replaces the shared one. Plan: Docs/Utnapishtim_Activities/Plan_UtnapishtimActivities.md. en-us: HouseActivities_loc.json.",
